{"id":"n84899-1-7","stage":5,"title":"한바탕 · 一场","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84899-1-7-1","ko":"뭐야, 분위기가 왜 이렇게 냉랭해?","zh":"怎么了，气氛怎么这么冷淡啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐야,","meaning":"怎么了","explanation":"뭐：怎么了；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}},{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"1","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분위기가","audio":"/audio/aeafae1134479b98bf89.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"냉랭해?","meaning":"冷冰冰，冷淡","explanation":"냉랭하다：冷冰冰，冷淡；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"냉랭하다","audio":"/audio/0bfdba717f3ade20fc6a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41200","senseId":"2","lemma":"냉랭하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉랭해","audio":"/audio/a83dec058d652dc91cca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"怎么了","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"应答别人的话，表示疑问。","pronunciation":[